  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LtiWRLKx\">相关链接：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-EAtfY4iO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Owe6jwhF\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710643975180\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建智能电话</a> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dKeUbtEM\"> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710644556812\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取智能电话列表</a></li></ul><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-S7VocrfC\"><strong>智能电话组件</strong>：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MhdyGWAH\">1、产品基本功能 智能电话又称AXB（A为客户，B为用户），当B想要联系A时，我们为其分配一个中间虚拟号去转接，达到获取通话话单的目的（借此上报转化和作为有效性赔付的凭证）。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-9rSW0Cwn\">2、适用行业 销售线索收集为主，比如：教育培训，招商加盟等</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VIblCggU\">3、覆盖范围 -建站落地页 -附加创意</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-R7IJUZGl\">青鸟主页：<a href=\"https://clue.oceanengine.com/static/platform/main\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://clue.oceanengine.com/static/platform/main</a></p></div>",
